<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 26.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - MAY 26.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the main headlines reported by KUKU Raadio on Monday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and cannot vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Today is the 70th anniversary of the founding of Fenno -Ugria, a Finno-Urgic society, which is being marked with a conference and exhibitions.</p>
<p>-Russian President Yeltsin intends to participate in the July summit in Spain being held to discuss NATO expansion.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
